  "coveredBehavior": [
    "The actual V3 funding store retains declared funding data; it does not create or sign a chain payment.",
    "The actual borrowed V3 client persists and reads back the exact original request and dispatch intent before the declared request bridge calls the actual scoped backend session.",
    "The actual backend succeeds once; the actual client observes the declared 200 response framing. One bridge, one backend handle and one execute callback are observed.",
    "Submitting the same original again is recovery-fenced without another bridge, backend call or execute callback.",
    "After known borrowed-client and funding-store closes, the existing owned recovery-only reader opens the same private synthetic funding database in the same process.",
    "The reader returns the exact original and dispatch intent, POSSIBLY_ATTEMPTED, authority NONE and service outcome NOT_ESTABLISHED without dispatching.",
    "The reader, backend session and fixture store report their expected close outcomes; declared handles and pending originals are zero, and one declared timer is cancelled."
  ],
